    "title": "Planning the Spring Glaze Workshop",
    "text": "Subject: Spring Glaze Workshop — 8 places\n\nHi everyone,\n\nThis spring I'm teaching a four-week glaze workshop at the studio, on Tuesday evenings from 6:30 to 9:00 PM. You will make two mugs or bowls, glaze them, and take them home on the last evening.\n\nThe class is $195. That includes the clay, the glazes, and both firings. There are 8 places, because that is what fits in one kiln load.\n\nReply to this email to save a place.\n\nWren\nLarkfield Ceramics",
